                  <path d="M2 2a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V2zm10-1H4a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v12a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h8a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="mb-2">Comprehensive Summary</h5>
              <p class="mb-0">AI-generated abstract and key findings extracted from your research paper with precision and accuracy.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm feature-card">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-start">
            <div class="feature-icon me-3">
              <div class="feature-icon-bg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-easel text-primary" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                  <path d="M8 0a.5.5 0 0 1 .473.337L9.046 2H14a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-1.85l1.323 3.837a.5.5 0 1 1-.946.326L11.092 11H8.5v3a.5.5 0 0 1-1 0v-3H4.908l-1.435 4.163a.5.5 0 1 1-.946-.326L3.85 11H2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V3a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h4.954L7.527.337A.5.5 0 0 1 8 0M2 3v7h12V3z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="mb-2">Professional Slides</h5>
              <p class="mb-0">Automatically generated presentation slides with proper formatting, visual hierarchy, and academic standards.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm feature-card">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-start">
            <div class="feature-icon me-3">
              <div class="feature-icon-bg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-clock text-primary" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                  <path d="M8 3.5a.5.5 0 0 0-1 0V9a.5.5 0 0 0 .252.434l3.5 2a.5.5 0 0 0 .496-.868L8 8.71V3.5z"/>
                  <path d="M8 16A8 8 0 1 0 8 0a8 8 0 0 0 0 16zm7-8A7 7 0 1 1 1 8a7 7 0 0 1 14 0z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="mb-2">Fast Processing</h5>
              <p class="mb-0">Transform hours of manual work into minutes of automated processing. Perfect for tight deadlines.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6">
      <div class="card h-100 border-0 shadow-sm feature-card">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <div class="d-flex align-items-start">
            <div class="feature-icon me-3">
              <div class="feature-icon-bg">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" class="bi bi-download text-primary" viewBox="0 0 16 16">
                  <path d="M.5 9.9a.5.5 0 0 1 .5.5v2.5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h12a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2.5a.5.5 0 0 1 1 0v2.5a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H2a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2.5a.5.5 0 0 1 .5-.5z"/>
                  <path d="M7.646 11.854a.5.5 0 0 0 .708 0l3-3a.5.5 0 0 0-.708-.708L8.5 10.293V1.5a.5.5 0 0 0-1 0v8.793L5.354 8.146a.5.5 0 1 0-.708.708l3 3z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="mb-2">Easy Access</h5>
              <p class="mb-0">View your presentations online or download them for offline use. Compatible with all major presentation software.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- FAQ Section -->
<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row text-center mb-5">
    <div class="col-12">
      <h2 class="display-5 fw-bold mb-3">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      <p class="lead">Everything you need to know about using SimplyResearch</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8">
      <div class="card shadow-lg border-0 mb-4">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <h5 class="text-dark mb-3">What file formats are supported?</h5>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">Currently, SimplyResearch supports PDF files only. Your research paper must be in PDF format and under 10MB in size.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card shadow-lg border-0 mb-4">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <h5 class="text-dark mb-3">How long does processing take?</h5>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">Processing typically takes 1-3 minutes depending on the length and complexity of your research paper. You'll see a progress indicator during processing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card shadow-lg border-0 mb-4">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <h5 class="text-dark mb-3">Can I edit the generated slides?</h5>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">Yes! Once your presentation is generated, you can download it and edit it using any presentation software like PowerPoint, Google Slides, or Keynote.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card shadow-lg border-0 mb-4">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <h5 class="text-dark mb-3">Is my research data secure?</h5>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">Absolutely. We take data security seriously. Your research papers are processed securely and are not stored permanently on our servers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="card shadow-lg border-0">
        <div class="card-body p-4">
          <h5 class="text-dark mb-3">What types of research papers work best?</h5>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">SimplyResearch works best with academic research papers, journal articles, conference papers, and thesis documents with clear structure and methodology.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- CTA Section -->
<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row justify-content-center">
    <div class="col-lg-8 text-center">
      <div class="card shadow-lg border-0">
        <div class="card-body p-5">
          <h2 class="h3 mb-4 text-dark">Ready to Get Started?</h2>
          <p class="lead text-muted mb-4">
            Now that you know how SimplyResearch works, why not try it out with your own research paper?
          </p>
          <%= link_to "Create Your First Presentation", root_path, class: "btn btn-primary btn-lg" %>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
